# Hard-block secrets from Cursor index, @-mention, Tab, and Agent reads.
# Syntax is gitignore. Cursor also inherits this repo's .gitignore.
# Do NOT list AGENTS.md, _config.yml, _pages, _data, or docs/CUSTOMIZE.md here.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub
credentials.json
secrets.json
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
